  </div>
</section>

<section class="acdt-intro content-section" aria-labelledby="intro-heading">
  <h2 id="intro-heading" class="sr-only">About Middle European Summer Time to Eastern Standard Time Conversion</h2>
  <p>
    Welcome to our premier <strong>MEST to EST Converter</strong>. This specialized calculator provides accurate time conversion between <strong>Middle European Summer Time (MEST, UTC+2)</strong>—also widely known as Central European Summer Time (CEST)—and <strong>Eastern Standard Time (EST, UTC-5)</strong>. Under standard offset rules, Eastern Standard Time is <strong>7 hours behind Middle European Summer Time</strong>. When it is 4:00 PM in Paris, Berlin, Rome, or Madrid, it is 9:00 AM in New York, Washington D.C., and Boston.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Middle European Summer Time (MEST)</strong> is observed across more than 30 European countries from late March to late October. Major continental economies including France, Germany, Italy, Spain, Netherlands, Belgium, Switzerland, Austria, Poland, Sweden, and Norway shift their clocks forward to UTC+2 to maximize evening daylight during spring and summer.
  </p>
  <p>
    Across the Atlantic, <strong>Eastern Standard Time (EST, UTC-5)</strong> serves as the financial and political anchor for the Eastern United States and Canada. During the North American summer, US regions switch to Eastern Daylight Time (EDT, UTC-4), which narrows the difference between Central Europe and New York to <strong>6 hours</strong>.
  </p>
  <p>
    Whether you are a <strong>trader</strong> arbitrating equity prices between Euronext/DAX and the New York Stock Exchange, a <strong>supply chain director</strong> managing container shipments from Rotterdam to North American ports, an <strong>airline passenger</strong> booking transatlantic flights, or a <strong>software team lead</strong> syncing sprints between Berlin and New York, our tool delivers instant 100% accurate time conversions.
  </p>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
